            "markup": "\u003C!-- Header --\u003E\n\u003Cheader class=\u0022header-bg header-bg-solid\u0022 id=\u0022site-header\u0022 tabindex=\u0022-1\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022container\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022row\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv id=\u0022logo\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/\u0022 title=\u00223chillies\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/kqbgur0m/3chillies-logo.png?format=webp\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022An image of the 3chillies Logo\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/kqbgur0m/3chillies-logo.png?format=webp\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003Cspan\u003E3chillies\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!-- Expand --\u003E\n\u003Cbutton aria-expanded=\u0022false\u0022 aria-label=\u0022Expand header\u0022 class=\u0022expand-header expand-3-bars expand-uneven-lines expand-active-cross\u0022 id=\u0022burgerNavStyle\u0022 type=\u0022button\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cspan\u003EMenu\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003C/button\u003E\n\u003C!--// Expand --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Main navigation --\u003E\n\n\u003C!--// Main navigation --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Secondary navigation --\u003E\n\u003C!--// Secondary navigation --\u003E\n\u003C!-- CTA Links --\u003E\n\n\u003C!--// CTA Links --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Site search --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv aria-label=\u0022Site search\u0022 class=\u0022form site-search-form site-search\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cform action=\u0022/search/\u0022 method=\u0022get\u0022 name=\u0022searchForm\u0022 role=\u0022search\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cfieldset\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022form-group\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cinput aria-label=\u0022Search the site\u0022 class=\u0022form-control\u0022 maxlength=\u0022256\u0022 name=\u0022search_field\u0022 placeholder=\u0022Search the site\u0022 type=\u0022text\u0022 value=\u0022\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cbutton aria-label=\u0022Search\u0022 class=\u0022btn base-btn-bg base-btn-bg-solid base-btn-bg-hover base-btn-bg-hover-solid base-btn-text base-btn-borders btn-search\u0022 role=\u0022button\u0022 type=\u0022submit\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cspan\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Ci aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022 class=\u0022icon usn_ion-ios-search\u0022\u003E\u003C/i\u003E\n\u003C/button\u003E\n\u003C/fieldset\u003E\n\u003C/form\u003E\n\u003Cbutton aria-expanded=\u0022false\u0022 aria-label=\u0022Expand site search\u0022 class=\u0022expand-search\u0022 data-bs-toggle=\u0022collapse\u0022 type=\u0022button\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cem\u003EExpand Search\u003C/em\u003E\n\u003Ci aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022 class=\u0022icon usn_ion-ios-search search-icon\u0022\u003E\u003C/i\u003E\n\u003Ci aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022 class=\u0022icon usn_ion-md-close close-icon\u0022\u003E\u003C/i\u003E\n\u003C/button\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Site search --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/header\u003E\n\u003C!--// Header --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Content --\u003E\n\u003Cmain id=\u0022site-content\u0022 tabindex=\u0022-1\u0022\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content base-bg\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022container\u0022\u003E \u003C!-- Row --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022row\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022heading-col col\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ch1 class=\u0022heading main base-heading\u0022\u003E3chillies continues to support the UK public sector with a G-Cloud 14 listing\u003C/h1\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Row --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022row justify-content-between\u0022\u003E\n\u003C!-- Content column --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022content-col left-col col-lg-8 col-12 order-1\u0022\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_banner base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item_medium-banner base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003C!-- IMAGE --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv aria-label=\u0022Close up image of the pillar of a bridge taken against a bright blue sky\u0022 class=\u0022image lazyload background-image\u0022 data-bgset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 data-sizes=\u0022auto\u0022 role=\u0022img\u0022 style=\u0022background-image:url(\u0027https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/jrrnb2c3/golden-gate.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=140\u0026amp;v=1dc0773c26e1520\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0027)\u0022\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// IMAGE --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_breadcrumb base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022breadcrumb-trail\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00220s\u0022\u003E\n\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_text base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOver the past few years 3chillies are proud to have been involved in some major digital projects for public sector and government organisations. We\u2019ve worked with some very well-known clients (which we\u2019re unfortunately not allowed to tell you about) and we continue to support them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe\u2019re thrilled to announce that we\u2019ve formally been accepted into the G-Cloud 14 framework which will help us continue to provide services to the UK public sector.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EG-Cloud 14 is an official UK-government managed supplier list that helps public sector organisations to procure expert help for\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Ecloud hosting services\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Ecloud software services\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Eassociated support services.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe\u2019ve been listed on predecessor versions of the framework including G-Cloud 12 and G-Cloud 13 as well as the related Digital Outcomes 6, which lists a wider range of services relating to digital and outsourcing projects.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn our listings our services relating to two areas are listed:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Esoftware development and cloud migration services\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003Ewebsite, app \u0026amp; API hosting, support and maintenance.\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFrameworks like G-Cloud 14 play a pivotal role in driving innovation across the public sector, and also help to save precious time in procuring services (and therefore taxpayer\u2019s money).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOf course, they have helped us to build up our services to the public sector, and we look forward to continuing working with some great people at amazing clients.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you\u2019d like to discuss more about G-Cloud framework, then \u003Ca href=\u0022/contact/\u0022 title=\u0022Contact\u0022\u003Eget in touch!\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component usn_cmp_subpagelisting base-bg base-bg-solid\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003C!-- Introduction --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-introduction row justify-content-start text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info col\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading base-heading\u0022\u003ERelated Blog posts\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Introduction --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022repeatable-content tab-content\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv aria-labelledby=\u0022nav_tab_afbc3013-2e54-4d3b-a5c8-2812ac756501_0\u0022 class=\u0022tab-pane show active\u0022 id=\u0022nav_afbc3013-2e54-4d3b-a5c8-2812ac756501_0\u0022 role=\u0022tabpanel\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022component-main row slides listing listing_basic-grid\u0022 data-slick=\u0027{\u0022dots\u0022: false ,\u0022arrows\u0022: true ,\u0022slidesToShow\u0022: 3, \u0022responsive\u0022: [{\u0022breakpoint\u0022: 768,\u0022settings\u0022: {\u0022slidesToShow\u0022: 2}},{\u0022breakpoint\u0022: 575,\u0022settings\u0022: {\u0022slidesToShow\u0022: 1}}],\u0022fade\u0022: false }\u0027\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/how-3chillies-is-supporting-the-public-sector-g-cloud-13-and-digital-outcomes-6/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/qz1j3gjc/wires-7997980_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc07776b2a28e0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/qz1j3gjc/wires-7997980_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc07776b2a28e0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Image of an electricity pilon with wires against a pale sky\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/qz1j3gjc/wires-7997980_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc07776b2a28e0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/qz1j3gjc/wires-7997980_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc07776b2a28e0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/qz1j3gjc/wires-7997980_1280.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc07776b2a28e0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EHow 3Chillies is supporting the public sector: G-Cloud 13 and Digital Outcomes 6\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOver the last few years 3Chillies has delivered many successful digital projects for government and public sector organisations, and it\u2019s been an important area for our business.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E14 Nov 2022\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/public-sector/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Public Sector\u0022\u003EPublic Sector\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/3chillies-supports-the-public-sector-with-a-g-cloud-12-listing/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/aswibxmc/usgs-hos3dzgphzw-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077b34a80270\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/aswibxmc/usgs-hos3dzgphzw-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077b34a80270\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Abstract image showing pink and blue clouds of ink\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/aswibxmc/usgs-hos3dzgphzw-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077b34a80270\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/aswibxmc/usgs-hos3dzgphzw-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077b34a80270\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/aswibxmc/usgs-hos3dzgphzw-unsplash.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc077b34a80270\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003E3chillies supports the public sector with a G-Cloud 12 listing\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003E3chillies has a strong track record of working with public sector organisations and government departments. We\u2019re pleased to announce that we are now listed on the G-Cloud 12 framework.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E10 Dec 2020\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/public-sector/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Public Sector\u0022\u003EPublic Sector\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component meta base-bg\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E06 Nov 2024\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/public-sector/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Public Sector\u0022\u003EPublic Sector\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/3chillies-news/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u00223chillies News\u0022\u003E3chillies News\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C!-- Author Bio --\u003E\n\u003Csection class=\u0022content component author-bio base-bg\u0022\u003E\n\u003